# Phase 6: the AI bridge on COM2 with beehive's fake backend (no LLM needed).
@ai
$ ai
AI features: on
bridge:      COM2, beehive online (fake fake)
$ ask "how do I copy a file?"
BeeHive fake backend (no LLM).
Current directory: /
Question: how do I copy a file?
~ ^This last line is deliberately long, so that it has to be wrapped onto more$
~ ^than one line on the 80-column console of BeeCodersOs\.$
$ explain
Nothing to explain: no failed command or crash yet.
$ frobnicate
$ explain
Explaining: frobnicate
~ ^  frobnicate$
~ ^  frobnicate: command not found \(type 'help'\)$
$ wish a text editor
Thanks! Saved to /system/inbox/signals.jsonl and sent to the AI host.
$^C ask something slow
(cancelled)
$ ai off
AI features switched off.
$ ask hello
AI is switched off ('ai on' to enable)
$ ai on
AI features switched on.
$ log 15
~ "ev":"ai","kind":"ask","result":"done"
@signal "kind": "wish", "text": "a text editor"
@signal "kind": "missed", "text": "frobnicate"
